CLAIM CrackAll.C1 STATUS DECLARED TEXT "exact literal resolution precedes semantic similarity"
CLAIM CrackAll.C2 STATUS DECLARED TEXT "historical alias and current canonical form remain separate records unless evidence establishes identity"
CLAIM CrackAll.C3 STATUS DECLARED TEXT "related does not imply same; indexed does not imply admitted; user-approved does not rewrite historical attribution"
CLAIM CrackAll.C4 STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "the generated RMAL source contains one COINED_NAME entity for every entry in Pass4"
CLAIM CrackAll.C5 STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "every emitted relation denies authority and evidence transfer"

BOUNDARY CrackAll.C4 CLAIM_CEILING VERIFIED_GENERATION REASON "structural generation check only; not a full RMALC compilation result"

# User-language execution surface
ATTRIBUTE CrackAll.DecisionField KEY USER_SURFACE VALUE "SEEK exact -> DISTINGUISH aliases -> RELATE ancestors/descendants -> ROTATE representation -> RECONSTRUCT lineage -> PRESERVE remainder -> CONTINUE"
ATTRIBUTE CrackAll.DecisionField KEY STOP VALUE "SUCCESS when target name is resolved within declared corpus bounds or returned UNRESOLVED"